## Hint Cause: 33 Reports

The booking-v3 form's date field shows hint text "MM/DD/YYYY" (US format). When used by day-first locale tenants, users type DD/MM as their locale expects, but the form reads it as MM/DD, swapping day and month.

**Affected:** Day-first locale users on booking-v3 form

**Root Cause:** booking-v3 form has hardcoded MM/DD hint text that doesn't match day-first locale expectations.

**GitHub Issue:** https://github.com/piotrczarnak/mega/issues/72

**Resolution:** WON'T FIX - booking-v3 form has been retired. Day-first tenants no longer use this form.

